# Anti-slop UI

Anchor: Data Golf + racing form. Diverge: Live/Lab split.

Before writing UI, read `docs/design/ui-design-contract.md`. Tokens live in `frontend/src/styles/themes.css`. New look goes in `frontend/src/styles/desk.css` only.

Do not:

- Add a new CSS file or `@import` overlay
- Use Inter, Geist, Roboto, or purple/indigo/violet
- Use `backdrop-filter`, glass, grain, radial glows, or pulsing status dots
- Put monospace on labels or eyebrows
- Use four equal KPI tiles unless they are true peers
- Rebuild `/preview` or load `operator-tokens.css` on the main app

Do:

- Tables over card/bento walls
- Player face + name as the first column
- Status as a text pill (`LIVE`, `STALE`, `DOWN`)
- Disabled controls at 40% opacity
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`
